{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37745","headline":"献大京兆薛常侍能 · 郑谷","name":"献大京兆薛常侍能","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"耻将官业竞前途，自爱篇章古不如。\n一炷香新开道院，数坊人聚避朝车。\n纵游藉草花垂酒，闲卧临窗燕拂书。\n唯有明公赏新句，秋风不敢忆鲈鱼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37745.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37745","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}